<===> color/input.scss
@use "sass:color";
a {b: color.adjust(1)}

<===> color/error
Error: $color: 1 is not a color.
  ,
2 | a {b: color.adjust(1)}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:7  root stylesheet

<===> color/error-libsass
Error: $color: 1 is not a color.
  ,
2 | a {b: color.adjust(1)}
  |                    ^
  '
  input.scss 2:20  adjust()
  ,
2 | a {b: color.adjust(1)}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:7   root stylesheet

